WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:16.058
Brad: Where are we?

2
00:00:16.059 --> 00:00:21.401
Danny: I think . . . I think we're in the same place that we were before.

3
00:00:21.402 --> 00:00:23.937
Brad: What just happened?

4
00:00:23.938 --> 00:00:27.965
Danny: It was like an explosion.

5
00:00:27.966 --> 00:00:31.944
Brad: Where did Chuck and Dave go?

6
00:00:31.945 --> 00:00:35.808
Danny: They're . . . they're gone!

7
00:00:35.809 --> 00:00:38.944
Brad: Do you think . . . we shrunk them?

8
00:00:38.945 --> 00:00:41.058
Danny: Ha-ha! We must have.

9
00:00:41.059 --> 00:00:45.648
It worked! It worked!

10
00:00:45.649 --> 00:00:47.801
Brad: I don't see them.

11
00:00:47.802 --> 00:00:49.751
Danny: Who cares where they are?

12
00:00:49.752 --> 00:00:58.051
This is the best day ever! Bye-bye, bullies!

13
00:00:58.052 --> 00:01:04.107
Brad: I don't see footprints, so they didn't walk away.

14
00:01:04.108 --> 00:01:06.354
Danny: Brad, we shrunk them!

15
00:01:06.355 --> 00:01:08.865
That's what we wanted to do.

16
00:01:08.866 --> 00:01:12.417
Danny: You should be happy, not worried.

17
00:01:12.418 --> 00:01:15.510
Brad: I know, I know. But . . .

18
00:01:15.511 --> 00:01:17.705
Danny: But what?

19
00:01:17.706 --> 00:01:21.886
Brad: Well, if we did shrink them, and they're really tiny─

20
00:01:21.887 --> 00:01:24.511
Danny: We'll never see them again!

21
00:01:24.512 --> 00:01:29.225
Brad: They're in danger, Danny.

22
00:01:29.226 --> 00:01:31.870
Danny: I don't think I'm hearing you right.

23
00:01:31.871 --> 00:01:35.244
Danny: Why are you worried about those bullies?

24
00:01:35.245 --> 00:01:38.633
Danny: Maybe they're small and totally safe.

25
00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:41.492
Brad: Well . . . that could be possible.

26
00:01:41.493 --> 00:01:43.111
Danny: Our plan worked.

27
00:01:43.112 --> 00:01:45.248
Now we can go.

28
00:01:45.249 --> 00:01:48.623
Brad: But if they are in trouble, we should help them, Danny.

29
00:01:48.624 --> 00:01:52.615
Danny: Ugh! You're just as bad as Tina!

30
00:01:52.616 --> 00:01:56.674
Brad: Well, Tina and you are the ones who said it to me first.

31
00:01:56.675 --> 00:02:00.427
Danny: What do you mean?

32
00:02:00.428 --> 00:02:03.863
Tina: Oh, Brad! We need to help the giants.

33
00:02:03.864 --> 00:02:07.309
Tina: Imagine living in a world without color.

34
00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:09.948
Brad: Sure, that would be terrible.

35
00:02:09.949 --> 00:02:12.989
But why is it my problem?

36
00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:16.660
Danny: Because you can help, that's why.

37
00:02:16.661 --> 00:02:21.558
Brad: We should help Chuck and Dave for the same reason [n3@that we helped the giants.

38
00:02:21.559 --> 00:02:25.903
Brad: It's the reason you help anyone: because you can!

39
00:02:25.904 --> 00:02:29.269
Danny: Bleh! You sound like a teacher.

40
00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:33.478
Brad: Let's find them, at least, and see if they are okay.

41
00:02:33.479 --> 00:02:37.175
Danny: Find them, hmm. He-he.

42
00:02:37.176 --> 00:02:38.840
I'd like to see that.

43
00:02:38.841 --> 00:02:40.471
Brad: See what?

44
00:02:40.472 --> 00:02:43.524
Danny: What? Oh, nothing.

45
00:02:43.525 --> 00:02:46.738
Brad: Anyway, let's start looking.

46
00:02:46.739 --> 00:02:49.326
Danny: They could be anywhere.

47
00:02:49.327 --> 00:02:52.450
Brad: You go over there, and I'll start here.

48
00:02:52.451 --> 00:02:56.451
Danny: Fine.

49
00:02:56.452 --> 00:02:58.829
Brad: Walk carefully!

50
00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:04.024
Danny: I will.

51
00:03:04.025 --> 00:03:07.966
Brad: Oh no!
